</office:master-styles>
<office:body><office:text>
<text:p text:style-name="First">PAGE ONE - A4 portrait</text:p>
<text:p>Original fictional layout verification. 简体中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · العربية · עברית</text:p>
<text:p><draw:frame text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:width="6cm" svg:height="4cm"><draw:image><office:binary-data>iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAIAAAACCAIAAAD91JpzAAAAFklEQVR4nGOQKegKWJDA8GJHwCYncwAlgQWC0QpQIwAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==</office:binary-data></draw:image></draw:frame></text:p>
<table:table table:name="Survey"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="2"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>Station A</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>1.25 metres</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table>
<text:p text:style-name="Next">PAGE TWO - A5 landscape</text:p><text:p>The landscape page keeps its own header, footer and dimensions.</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Columns">PAGE THREE - two columns</text:p><text:p>Observation 1. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 2. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 3. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 4. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 5. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 6. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 7. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 8. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 9. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 10. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 11. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 12. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 13. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 14. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 15. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 16. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 17. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p><text:p>Observation 18. Original test text about the river, light, water and changing paths. Check that reading order flows through both columns.</text:p>
